Subject: [PATCH] feat: let Talk to Shy drag, hover, fill in forms, upload
 files and read the console

- New tools: drag, hover, set_value, upload_file, console_messages and
  resize_window.
- click takes a button, a double or triple click and modifiers;
  press_key takes combinations such as cmd+shift+z and repeats;
  navigate goes back and forward; read_page reads one part of the page
  by ref, up to a size; screenshot zooms in on a region.
- upload_file takes a URL, content the agent sends, or a path on the
  Mac, which always asks first. The debugger lets the built-in
  extension read local files so that a path works.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
